  <summary>Manage your flatpaks with a simple GUI.</summary>
  <description>
    <p>It will help you install Flatpak apps in a user-friendly way. We have recipes for some of them to install them even better. </p>
    <p>For example, for Steam, it asks the user to choose a folder where they store their games before installation.</p>
    <p>And you can setup this games path in the settings page for all applications which need it (steam,lutris, heroic games launcher, bottles)</p>
    <p>Bundles are available to install multiple applications in same time</p>
    <p>You can install your local .flatpak files stored in Downloads directory (application is not allowed to access your other directories)</p>
    <p>You can downgrade an application version</p>
    <p>Available in many languages:</p>
    <p>- English</p>
    <p>- Spanish</p>
    <p>- French</p>
    <p>- Italian</p>
    <p>- Brazilian</p>
    <p>- Arabic</p>
    <p>- Romanian</p>
        
   </description>

